id: divinity-unleashed-true-god-of-war
name: True God of War
order: 8
slot: trait
# One of these is chosen (the Transformation's row asks).
group: domain-traits
groupLabel: Domain Traits
description: >
  Clashing in eternal conflict, you represent the drive of all beings who seek supremacy.
text: >
  True God of War: Clashing in eternal conflict, you represent the drive of all beings who seek supremacy.
  (1)-[Prerequisite]: Access to the God of War effect for the Option effect of Divine Magic.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase your Combat Rolls by 2(T) while you are wielding a Weapon.
  (3)-[Passive]: While you are wielding a Weapon, it gains the Divine Armament Quality without taking up any Quality slots.
  (4)-[Passive]: Ignore the Ki Point Cost for Magical Materialization if you create a Weapon through its effects.
  (5)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use the Divine Weapon God Maneuver, apply your Damage Attribute an additional time to that Attacking Maneuver.

---

[passive, effect 2]
if (wieldingWeapon) {
    combatRolls += 2(T);
}
# (3)-(5) Divine Armament, Magical Materialization, Divine Weapon: the table's.
